# Friendly, repointable address for the public event calendar — the link to
# hand out (Reddit, Discord) instead of the raw Google URL, so a future
# calendar migration repoints one line here rather than breaking every posted
# link. 302 on purpose: a cached 301 would pin old links to a dead calendar
# id. Pages applies these rules ahead of the SPA fallback; the Worker's
# /api/* route is unaffected. The old hostname's 301 preserves paths, so
# mtga-limited-ev.awknaust.me/calendar chains here too.
/calendar https://calendar.google.com/calendar/embed?src=c3fce5ebd85fb199a59badc1d32c5d2f5b93aa417729aefe00c846db3006423c%40group.calendar.google.com 302
